    dct:creator <https://w3id.org/squirrelpapers/person/0000-0002-3246-3531> ;
    dct:description """This repository contains Ogham Data of several data sources such as
Celtic Inscribed Stones Project (CISP)
Ogham in 3D Project
Corpus inscriptionum insularum Celticarum (1945)
The data is divided into
Geospatial Data
Ogham Data
The data belongs to the Irish ᚑᚌᚆᚐᚋ Stones in the Wikimedia Universe project. This project is funded by Wikimedia Deutschland and the Open Science Fellows Program.
# Change Log
fix turtle files
split geospatial turtle files"""@en ;
